msgid "The [`qiskit_bosons.operators`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/operators#module-qiskit_bosons.operators \"qiskit_bosons.operators\") and [`qiskit_bosons.operators.terms`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/operators-terms#module-qiskit_bosons.operators.terms \"qiskit_bosons.operators.terms\") modules document the complete interface.\n"
